# Coven counts different powers among the creatures you control: a declined search shuffles nothing, two 0-power
# Ornithopters and the Farmhand are three creatures but two powers, and the opponent's 2-power Grizzly Bears does not
# count, so the ability is refused; once Bot1's own Grizzly Bears makes three different powers it transforms, and the
# transformed creature gains life from combat damage (CR 207.2c, 701.27a, 702.15b; the coven ruling of 2021-09-24).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Ambitious Farmhand
Ornithopter
Grizzly Bears
Plains
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

