Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Ambitious Farmhand.Activate(Ability: Transform)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Seasoned Cathar.Transformed = true
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Seasoned Cathar > Bot2)
